${1} Pull request system [0/5]
   - [ ] Make sure there is 1H available for review and 1h for monitoring
   - [ ] Code is first reviewed and test cases from it are extracted
   - [ ] Code is tested [0/2]
     If needed, tests are made on staging - Ask yourself if it's necessary - Necessary if it uses external services, uses critical systems etc...
     - [ ] Introduced functionality is tested
     - [ ] Potential regressions are tested
   - [ ] PR description is complete [0/3]
     - [ ] Context is clearly described
     - [ ] Tests that were made are described
     - [ ] Step by step to testing is clearly explained
